[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さあ、お待ちかね！\n星誕の使者からの贈り物だよーっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "All right, the moment you've all been waiting for! A gift from the Starbirth Messengers!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こちらにご注目！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone, look this way!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ケーキだあ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's a cake!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "女の子",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でっけえー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's huuuge!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "男の子",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Boy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "では鏑矢さん、お願いします！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya, if you would!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ。堂免家の名にかけて――\nこの大役、果たして見せよう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Very well. On the honor of the Doumen family—I shall fulfill this grand duty."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あの人が持ってるの、剣……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is that a sword she's holding...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "女性",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Woman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いったい何が始まるんだ……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What's about to happen...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "男性",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Man"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふう……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hah..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "せやあああああっ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hyaaaah!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おおーーーっ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wooooow!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "住民たち",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Townspeople"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もう一丁いくぞ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "One more time!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よっ！\u3000ほっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hup! Hah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい！\u3000これがアタシたちからの贈り物だよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Here you go! This is our gift to you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わぁっ！\u3000ありがとう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yay! Thank you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "女の子",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Girl"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ねーちゃん、すげー！\u3000もう一回やってよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That was awesome! Do it again!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "男の子",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Boy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ、もちろんだ。獲物はまだ残っている",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course. There's still more to cut."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "最後の一かけらまで、この刀の錆にしてくれよう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I shall slice through every last piece!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お疲れさまー！\u3000はい、これ二人の分！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Great work, you two! Here's your share!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ……ありがとうございます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Th-thank you very much."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そちらこそご苦労だった。なかなか盛況であったな！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're the ones who worked hard. It was quite the success!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鏑矢さんのおかげだよ！\u3000結構大変だったでしょ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's all thanks to you! That must've been pretty tough, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いや、この程度大したことはない。\nこの国の民たちが満足してくれたのなら何よりだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Not at all—that was nothing. I'm just glad the people of this country enjoyed themselves."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふむ……この催し、我が国の行事にも取り入れて\nみるのはどうだろう。なあ、千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm... Perhaps we should incorporate this sort of celebration into our own festivals. What do you think, Chitose?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ。きっと楽しいと思います",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe. I think that would be wonderful."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今回のような菓子ではなく、たとえばそうだな……\n巨大な魚などを捌いてみるのはどうだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though instead of sweets like these, we could try... say, carving up a massive fish."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "領民たちも皆、喜ぶに違いない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm certain our people would be delighted."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そのときはアタシたちも呼んでね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Make sure to invite us when you do!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ、もちろんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course. You'll be the first to know."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]